// B3.2 auto-rescue test (COLLABORATIVE - run only AFTER golden is populated:
// in the app, apply a firmware then Recovery -> Save as golden, so both the
// golden image and the current-app metadata exist).
//
// This deliberately erases one 2 KB page in the middle of the app slot to
// simulate a corrupted / power-lost-mid-copy app image, then resets. On boot the
// bootloader's validate_and_recover() should notice app-slot CRC != current-meta
// and automatically restore the golden image -> the mouse boots healthy again.
si SWD
speed 4000
device STM32G474RE
connect
h
erase 0x08020000 0x08020800
r
g
qc
